		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδιαφορ-διδρήσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δράσομαι</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
